From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fernando Luiz Cola <fernando.luiz@pantacor.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:10:08 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] plugins/pv_lxc: drop the unused pv_export.h include

Nothing in Pantavisor uses lxc_namespace_t or the LXC_NS_* values that
lxc/pv_export.h declares, and it is the only reason Pantavisor's lxc
fork installs that header. Without the include, Pantavisor builds
against lxc with only the patches it needs.

Signed-off-by: Fernando Luiz Cola <fernando.luiz@pantacor.com>
---
 plugins/pv_lxc.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/plugins/pv_lxc.c b/plugins/pv_lxc.c
index 10d2ecf8..add9c7eb 100644
--- a/plugins/pv_lxc.c
+++ b/plugins/pv_lxc.c
@@ -34,7 +34,6 @@
 #include <sys/types.h>
 #include <signal.h>
 #include <lxc/lxccontainer.h>
-#include <lxc/pv_export.h>
 #include <limits.h>
 #include <unistd.h>
 #include <stdbool.h>
